{"id":46058,"date":"2025-10-25T11:33:52","date_gmt":"2025-10-25T10:33:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-chicago-2027\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:36:21","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:36:21","slug":"maratona-de-chicago","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-chicago\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Chicago 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Chicago 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Chicago 2026<\/strong> (<em>Bank of America Chicago Marathon<\/em>) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>11 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong>, na m\u00edtica metr\u00f3pole de <strong>Chicago<\/strong>, no estado de Illinois, <strong>Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica<\/strong>. Integrante do seleto circuito das <em>Abbott World Marathon Majors<\/em> (Major), a prova \u00e9 mundialmente famosa pela sua velocidade supers\u00f3nica, multid\u00f5es entusiastas de milh\u00f5es de espetadores e recordes mundiais hist\u00f3ricos.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e chegada apote\u00f3tica no exuberante <strong>Grant Park<\/strong> (junto ao lago Michigan e \u00e0 Columbus Drive), o percurso de <strong>42,195 km<\/strong> arranca a partir das <strong>07h30<\/strong>. O tra\u00e7ado totalmente plano e veloz atravessa 29 bairros multiculturais de Chicago \u2014 desde The Loop, Lincoln Park e Chinatown at\u00e9 Pilsen \u2014 oferecendo aos mais de 50.000 corredores globais uma atmosfera eletrizante e a oportunidade de conquistar uma das medalhas Major mais cobi\u00e7adas do planeta.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">11 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 07:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Grant Park, Chicago, Illinois, Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica, Chicago (EUA), Am\u00e9rica<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Maratona 42.195 km e Abbott Chicago 5K<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Bank of America \/ Abbott World Marathon Majors<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6h30 de dura\u00e7\u00e3o m\u00e1xima<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Bank of America Chicago Marathon 42.195 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 11 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 07:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Lottery \/ Time Qualifier:<\/strong> Oficial WMM<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Fases Oficiais)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Curta<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Abbott Chicago 5K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 10 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 07:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Aberta:<\/strong> Oficial<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 esgotar)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza a Maratona de Chicago 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A corrida realiza-se no domingo, <strong>11 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong>, com partidas divididas em vagas (waves) a partir das <strong>07h30<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde fica a zona de partida e chegada?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Tanto a partida como a linha de meta localizam-se no <strong>Grant Park<\/strong> (na Columbus Drive), no cora\u00e7\u00e3o de Chicago.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A Maratona de Chicago faz parte das World Marathon Majors?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, \u00e9 uma das seis <strong>Abbott World Marathon Majors<\/strong>, reunindo anualmente os melhores maratonistas da elite mundial.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite oficial da maratona?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite de conclus\u00e3o \u00e9 de <strong>6 horas e 30 minutos<\/strong> a partir do momento em que a \u00faltima vaga cruza a linha de partida.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como posso participar ou inscrever-me?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O acesso faz-se por sorteio p\u00fablico (lottery), tempos m\u00ednimos de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o por idade ou atrav\u00e9s de ag\u00eancias de viagens oficiais no portal <a href=\"https:\/\/www.chicagomarathon.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Chicago Marathon<\/a>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Chicago 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-11\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Grant Park, Chicago, Illinois, Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Chicago (EUA)\", \"addressRegion\": \"Am\u00e9rica\", \"addressCountry\": \"US\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Bank of America \/ Abbott World Marathon Majors\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza a Maratona de Chicago 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A corrida realiza-se no domingo, 11 de Outubro de 2026 , com partidas divididas em vagas (waves) a partir das 07h30 .\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde fica a zona de partida e chegada?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Tanto a partida como a linha de meta localizam-se no Grant Park (na Columbus Drive), no cora\u00e7\u00e3o de Chicago.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A Maratona de Chicago faz parte das World Marathon Majors?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, \u00e9 uma das seis Abbott World Marathon Majors , reunindo anualmente os melhores maratonistas da elite mundial.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite oficial da maratona?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tempo limite de conclus\u00e3o \u00e9 de 6 horas e 30 minutos a partir do momento em que a \u00faltima vaga cruza a linha de partida.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como posso participar ou inscrever-me?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O acesso faz-se por sorteio p\u00fablico (lottery), tempos m\u00ednimos de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o por idade ou atrav\u00e9s de ag\u00eancias de viagens oficiais no portal Chicago Marathon .\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66247,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,31],"event_type_2":[1069,1070],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-46058","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-chicago-estados-unidos-da-america","event_type-corrida","event_type-maratona","event_type_2-america","event_type_2-usa"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/maratona-de-chicago-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning